195:- **R-165 | Паганель data schema (owner decision 15.10)** — places/paths store REAL coordinates + friction coefficient per path type (тракт/река/море); travel days computed on the fly (haversine ÷ world day-norm ~20–30 km walk; norm = world/epoch parameter); days NEVER stored. Calibration direction by world type: invented world = PLAYER'S WORD primary («две недели пути» = binding, calibrates map coordinates; compute then matches words by construction); real world = gazetteer coords primary, days computed; mixed = real canvas + book points attached, never moved. External LLM receives computed distances/days as given facts, never computes from coords. Player position in live turn kept APPROXIMATE by engine (enough for edge triggers), event displacement (storm etc.) shifts it — code applies shift, precision never required. Map viz = feature on TNS TypeScript stack, LOCAL rendering from GeoJSON (map/grok-workspace design+structure reusable; its Leaflet CDN + Esri tiles = internet-dependent, do NOT copy; land.json+canvas pattern = the local-friendly one). Wording canon = dev/ folder (dev/GLOSSARY.md terms, e.g. «положение»). Source: AGENT-MECHANICS.md:90. Status: PLAN.
